@startuml sequence_start
title Sequence Diagram — Đăng ký người dùng (/start)

skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam SequenceBoxBackgroundColor LightBlue
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor DarkBlue
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor LightYellow

actor       "Người dùng"    as User
participant "Telegram API"  as TG
participant "Python Bot"    as Bot
participant "Java API\n(:8081)" as API
database    "MySQL"         as DB

User -> TG  : Gõ /start
TG   -> Bot : Update { message: "/start" }

Bot  -> Bot : Lấy user.id, user.full_name
note right : từ update.effective_user

Bot  -> API : POST /users/register\n{ telegramId, username, fullName }

API  -> DB  : SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE telegram_id = ?
DB  --> API : null (chưa có)

API  -> DB  : INSERT INTO users (...)\nINSERT INTO user_settings (...)
note right : UserSettings mặc định:\nnotify_* = true\nclassRemindBefore = 30 phút

DB  --> API : user_id = 1

API --> Bot : 201 Created\n{ id:1, telegramId:..., fullName:... }

Bot  -> TG  : sendMessage(chat_id,\n"👋 Xin chào Phương!\n🤖 Mình là HUSTStudy Bot...")
TG   -> User : Hiển thị tin nhắn chào + danh sách lệnh

@enduml
